  "feather": 0.025,
  "basis": "A rounded rectangle on the body's map, in its units: the face from under the hairline (the atlases paint cropped hair above it, each its own colour) to under the chin, and across to in front of the ears. The library's face is whole inside it and gives way to the body's own skin across the feather."
 },
